<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 2.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 2.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on October 1.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  Prime Credit Tr	 10.32     0.95</p>
<p>2  Villa World	     10.19     1.08</p>
<p>3  Prop Income Inv	 10.16     1.00</p>
<p>4  McIntosh Sec	    10.11     0.89</p>
<p>5  Indu Property	    9.89     0.92</p>
<p>6  BT Prop Trust	    9.60     1.70</p>
<p>7  Colonial Mutual	  9.45     1.12</p>
